Day 10 - OpenAPI & Swagger Documentation

Enterprise Financial Data Platform | Spring Boot 4.1.1 | springdoc-openapi 3.1.1

1. Objective

Add professional API documentation to Customer Service and Account Service using OpenAPI and Swagger UI. The goal was to make the existing REST endpoints discoverable and testable from a browser without changing runtime business behavior.

2. Why OpenAPI and Swagger

OpenAPI JSON is the machine-readable contract for the REST API, while Swagger UI is the human-friendly interactive view generated from that contract.

OpenAPI JSON -> /v3/api-docs
Swagger UI    -> /swagger-ui/index.html

3. Dependency Added

Added the Spring Boot 4-compatible springdoc dependency to both Customer Service and Account Service:

<dependency>
    <groupId>org.springdoc</groupId>
    <artifactId>springdoc-openapi-starter-webmvc-ui</artifactId>
    <version>3.1.1</version>
</dependency>

