13. Git Workflow

Day 10 work was accidentally committed on local develop. The changes were safely preserved by creating the feature branch from that commit, pushing the feature branch, then resetting local develop back to the Day 9 commit.

git checkout -b feature/day-10-openapi-documentation
git push -u origin feature/day-10-openapi-documentation
git checkout develop
git reset --hard HEAD~1

After the reset, local develop matched origin/develop at the Day 9 commit, while Day 10 remained safely available on the feature branch.

